@startuml
' Deliberately below-cliff: no name, no title, implicit participants,
' prose messages, vague guard, elision markers, no failure paths,
' unterminated alt, activation never closed. Same intended system as
' quote_flow.puml — degradation removes information, it does not change
' what the system is supposed to do.
Shipper -> QuoteAPI : ask for a freight quote
QuoteAPI -> QuoteStore : save it
activate QuoteAPI
alt if it seems risky
  QuoteAPI -> ScreeningService : do the screening stuff
  ScreeningService --> QuoteAPI : result

QuoteAPI -> TariffEngine : work out the price somehow
TariffEngine --> QuoteAPI : ok
QuoteAPI -> Shipper : send back the quote, or hold it, etc.
note right of QuoteAPI : TODO error handling, review flow, thresholds, ...
@enduml
